f Ukraine, Romania, Hungary, and Czechoslovakia from German occupation and received several honorifics for its service, including the Order of the Red Banner. The 6th Rifle Division was disbanded in the fall 1945.","LocalizedString":"The 125th Rifle Regiment was part of the 2nd formation of the 6th Rifle Division of the Red Army. The division fought numerous battles and campaigns on the Eastern Front, including Operation Barbarossa, 3rd Battle of Kharkov, Battle of Debrecen and finally the Soviet invasion of Manchuria. The division took part in the liberation of Ukraine, Romania, Hungary, and Czechoslovakia from German occupation and received several honorifics for its service, including the Order of the Red Banner. The 6th Rifle Division was disbanded in the fall 1945."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isReserved":true,"showBoostIcon":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDrawnFromDeck"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Guard","EHelpBubbleTypes::Trigger"],"hasGuard":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Medium'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Medium.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/Invasion/Soviet_infantry_advancing_-_Low_Feedback.Soviet_infantry_advancing_-_Low_Feedback","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Volmi Games","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/125th_Rifle_Regiment.125th_Rifle_Regiment","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":362.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_125_rifle_regiment_photo","SourceString":"Red Army soldiers and a tank during the Third Battle of Kharkov, 1943.","LocalizedString":"Red Army soldiers and a tank during the Third Battle of Kharkov, 1943."},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_ExplosionInfantryM'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/